  "body": "All agents buyers welcome\r\n\r\nPositioned on a peaceful street with lovely sea views, this beautifully designed and immaculately presented standalone home offers elegant family living in one of East Auckland's most desirable locations.\r\n\r\nThoughtfully crafted with both style and functionality in mind, this home showcases refined interiors, quality finishes, and a seamless layout perfectly suited for modern family life.\r\n\r\nFeaturing four spacious bedrooms upstairs, including two master bedrooms with ensuites, plus a shared family bathroom, the layout is perfectly suited for modern family living. Downstairs, the light-filled open-plan kitchen, dining, and living area flows effortlessly to the beautifully landscaped, easy-care gardens and outdoor spaces, complete with vegetable gardens. A convenient guest powder room and single internal access garage add further practicality and comfort.\r\n\r\nZoned for the highly sought-after Pigeon Mountain School, Bucklands Beach Intermediate, and Macleans College, with both Pigeon Mountain School and Bucklands Beach Intermediate only a short walk away, the location simply could not be more convenient for families with children.\r\n\r\nEnjoy the outstanding lifestyle benefits of this prime Eastern Beaches location, with Half Moon Bay Marina just moments away for easy ferry commuting, boating, dining, and waterfront leisure. Beautiful eastern beaches and Highland Park Shopping Centre are also within easy reach, offering superb convenience for everyday living.\r\n\r\nStylish, low-maintenance, and perfectly positioned - this is a home that combines comfort, convenience, and lifestyle beautifully.",
